  "room": {
    "name": "her room in the Cloister Halls",
    "description": "A modern dormitory room with smooth white walls and a flat ceiling with a strip of warm ward-light. Half of it is a tomboy's room: a game console and two controllers under a wall screen, a football and muddy sneakers by the door, a hoodie thrown over a desk chair, potted plants and seedling trays crowding the windowsill under a small violet grow-light. The other half is newer: a full-length mirror, a short rail of dresses with the shop tags still on, a few make-up pots lined up neatly on the desk. A single bed with a rumpled green duvet, and above it a framed photograph of two muddy, grinning children with their arms round each other. Warm golden afternoon light.",
    "locationId": "dormitories",
